      "description": "\"ENTSHO.com represents having a safe and sensible registrar opinion in your pocket!\" - ENT & AUDIOLOGY NEWS\n\nSearch for medical treatment of various Ear, Nose & Throat (ENT) diseases at the speed of thought!\n\nBuilt by a small doctor-led charity of clinicians who are donating their time, this app exists to help you help patients (especially when you're on-call and alone).\n\nIt provides accessible ENT advice for doctors and nurses. It is especially targeted at resident doctors covering ENT (hence 'SHO' – senior house officer) and professionals in emergency and primary care.\n\nBest feature? It's all offline!\n\nWhy pay?\n◈ All-in-one guide at the tip of your nose (sorry, finger)\n◈ Get access to medical content that's written and reviewed by senior doctors with decades of collective experience\n◈ One-time purchase; buy it once and own it forever (with free lifetime updates)!\n◈ Highlighted red flags to make it easier for you to spot and escalate urgent conditions\n◈ Advice on when is it a good time to get help from a senior\n◈ Lightweight and easy to use\n◈ Advice on how to work-up a presenting complaint\n◈ Learn more about what treatment works best for various common ENT presentations\n◈ Help a charity\n◈ Learn ENT tips and practical skills to help save lives\n◈ Search for content at the speed of thought\n◈ Manage your patients using up-to-date treatment guidelines\n◈ Show off your knowledge to your seniors\n◈ The content is written in a manner that would make it easy for you to quickly find the relevant information\n◈ After downloading it, no internet access is required!\n\nYour one-time purchase keeps this project alive and supports great education for ENT colleagues!",
