      "releaseNotes": "This is quite a big release!\n\n◈ We crushed so many bugs!\n◈ Fine-tuned (maybe using a tuning fork...) and polished many bits of the app. So, it should hopefully be faster and more responsive!\n◈ Added the long-awaited feature: the SEARCH function!\n◈ Added collapsable menus to make the lists look more neat.\n◈ Added many inter-links throughout the app, making it easier for you to find the relevant topics.\n◈ Updated the About Us page.\n◈ Updated all of the content.\n◈ And many more under-the-hood improvements!\n\nPlease let us know if you face any issues.\n\nHappy learning!",
